      "displayText": "Ah, you’re back! Thank you again for your\nprevious assistance, my good friend.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe manuscript I produced with your help was a\nsmash hit. It will be hitting shelves soon.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
