      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "First, I think we’ll need a Fairy-type Pokémon.\nSecond, a Dragon-type Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe third Pokémon should be an alpha Pokémon.\nAnd the fourth should be...a second alpha.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDo you think you can show me all those?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 218
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m counting on you—yes, you, the hero of my\nown personal tale.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCould you put those four in your party and come\nshow me? I can repeat my list whenever you like.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
