    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure I will",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750072006500200049002000770069006C006C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, thanks",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020007400680061006E006B00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, what a spoilsport you are! You showed me all\nyour Pokémon but don’t want to hear my idea?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please lend me your ear, dear friend.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C00650061007300650020006C0065006E00640020006D006500200079006F007500720020006500610072002C0020006400650061007200200066007200690065006E0064002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Once, in the city of Lumiose, there existed two\ncompeting schools dedicated to the martial arts.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>One was founded by <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>,\ndistinguished<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nby<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhard,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nunyielding strikes.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis style was known as the Path of\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 19,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 7052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>The other was founded by\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nspecializing<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfleet,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nflowing<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmovements.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis style was known as the Way of\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 23,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 7312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Both schools put their desire to become strongest\nabove all else in life.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTheir members vowed to have nothing to do with\nthe other style—except in battle.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 162
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>All who followed the Path of <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>\nwere<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbound<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nview<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nWay<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nof<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>’s<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfollowers<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nas<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmortal<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfoes.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nAnd vice versa.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nGoverned by that one unbreakable tenet, it was a\nhard-knock life in these schools of hard knocks...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 37,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 260
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>It came to pass that a match was declared:\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nof<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nstyle<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nversus<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nof<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> style.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis battle would decide once and for all which\nschool was strongest.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 37,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 8436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 205
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Everything was on the line. Whichever school\nwas defeated would be honor bound to disband.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYet the two Pokémon selected as the schools’\nchampions had a singular problem...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 8848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 179
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002> and\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwere<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndesperately<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nin love.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThey had broken the one rule that must never be\nbroken, meeting in secret outside of battle.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 19,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 9208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On the night before the fateful match was to\nbe held...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 9516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200074006800650020006E00690067006800740020006200650066006F0072006500200074006800650020006600610074006500660075006C0020006D0061007400630068002000770061007300200074006F000A00620065002000680065006C0064002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002> and\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>’s<U+0010><U+0001>븀\neyes<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmet—they<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nknew<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthere<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwas<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbut<U+0010><U+0001>븀\none<U+0010><U+0001>븀\noption!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nTogether,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthey<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfled<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ninto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe night!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 37,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 9636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So begins their thrilling story of love on the lam,\ntheir very lives on the line as they flee pursuit!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 9924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I have to admit my own experience with romance\nIS limited, so perhaps my novel will lack realism...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nBut I think it will be a tale for the ages, don’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 10140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 162
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m sure it will be!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 10464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200073007500720065002000690074002000770069006C006C00200062006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah...sure it’ll be",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 10508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002E002E002E00730075007200650020006900742019006C006C0020006200650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now I’d better get it all down on paper so I can\nsubmit my manuscript to Lumiose Press!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 10552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can’t thank you enough for your help. You WILL\ncome through with that blurb once it’s a hit, yes?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 10736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    }
